{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T12:03:16.219Z","ordinal":8854,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019fef25-06a9-7cf3-99a2-3ea61f12f122","turn_id":"019ff047-606e-7151-aa76-510d68951809","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_017eccd7b592b193016a7b0f81c350819185ecb294a6a16da7","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The matched benchmark is valid: baseline 1,144.2 req/s versus v2 1,063.8 req/s, a 7.0% decrease—inside the 10% gate—while cold starts fell from 0.40% to 0.20% and active-load worker churn fell from 37 kills to zero. The metrics also exposed one conservative-accounting bug in the new code: before any cgroup sample exists, admission must reserve the declared worker limit rather than the 16 MiB floor. I’m correcting that before recording memory results."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1786449793900,"completed_at_ms":1786449796219}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T12:03:16.228Z","ordinal":8855,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_017eccd7b592b193016a7b0f81c350819185ecb294a6a16da7","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The matched benchmark is valid: baseline 1,144.2 req/s versus v2 1,063.8 req/s, a 7.0% decrease—inside the 10% gate—while cold starts fell from 0.40% to 0.20% and active-load worker churn fell from 37 kills to zero. The metrics also exposed one conservative-accounting bug in the new code: before any cgroup sample exists, admission must reserve the declared worker limit rather than the 16 MiB floor. I’m correcting that before recording memory results."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019ff047-606e-7151-aa76-510d68951809"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T12:03:18.288Z","ordinal":8856,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_017eccd7b592b193016a7b0f8418c481919a4d417b6cddf9ec","status":"completed","call_id":"call_fFl4HqTHfg0hEuAV4rJzN0zs","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/dev/Orva/backend/internal/pool/function_pool.go\\n@@\\n func (p *functionPool) admissionBytes() int64 {\\n \\td := p.snapshotDemand(time.Now())\\n+\\tif d.MemoryP95 <= 0 {\\n+\\t\\treturn p.memoryBytes\\n+\\t}\\n \\tbytes := d.MemoryP95\\n \\tif bytes < 16<<20 {\\n \\t\\tbytes = 16 << 20\\n \\t}\\n-\\tif bytes <= 0 || bytes > p.memoryBytes {\\n+\\tif bytes > p.memoryBytes {\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019ff047-606e-7151-aa76-510d68951809"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T12:03:18.647Z","ordinal":8857,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019fef25-06a9-7cf3-99a2-3ea61f12f122","turn_id":"019ff047-606e-7151-aa76-510d68951809","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-0b293b0c-94c6-4af8-94ed-30fea46d205f","changes":{"/home/dev/Orva/backend/internal/pool/function_pool.go":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -228,2 +228,5 @@\n \td := p.snapshotDemand(time.Now())\n+\tif d.MemoryP95 <= 0 {\n+\t\treturn p.memoryBytes\n+\t}\n \tbytes := d.MemoryP95\n@@ -232,3 +235,3 @@\n \t}\n-\tif bytes <= 0 || bytes > p.memoryBytes {\n+\tif bytes > p.memoryBytes {\n \t\tbytes = p.memoryBytes\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/dev/Orva/backend/internal/pool/function_pool.go\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1786449798413,"completed_at_ms":1786449798647}}
